Oratcl for Windows

This directory contains a prebuilt version of Oratcl for the windows
operating system.  It was compiled with stubs enabled, with Microsoft
visual studion 6.0, and with Tcl 8.3.2.

There are 4 files necessary for oratcl to operate on windows.

they are : oratcl31.dll oralob.tcl oralong.tcl pkgIndex.tcl

oratcl31.dll needs to be in your tcl\bin

	i.e. c:\program files\tcl\bin\oratcl31.dll

the 3 tcl files need to be in tcl\lib\oratcl3.1

	i.e. c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl3.1\pkgIndex.tcl
	     c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl3.1\oralob.tcl
	     c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl3.1\oralong.tcl

to use oratcl after installing, use the package require command of Tcl/Tk.

% package require Oratcl

or

% package require -exact Oratcl 3.1
